1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.178
Mwaramutse, Ndi Serzen Patel.

2
00:00:03.178 --> 00:00:08.739
Muri iyi videwo, tuzerekana

3
00:00:08.739 --> 00:00:14.300
wowe uburyo bwo gukoresha binocular indirect

4
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.387
ophthalmoscope cyangwa BIO.

5
00:00:15.387 --> 00:00:19.735
Ikoreshwa nyamukuru rya BIO nugukora ikizamini cya fundus.

6
00:00:19.735 --> 00:00:20.460
Iremera

7
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:25.043
umukoresha kugirango abone stereoskopi yagutse yo kureba cyangwa 3D kureba

8
00:00:25.043 --> 00:00:26.680
inyuma y'ijisho.

9
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:30.814
Iyo indinganizo ya scleral ikoreshwa, urashobora kandi kubona byihuse kandi bigenda neza

10
00:00:30.814 --> 00:00:31.700
kure

11
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.708
ya retina.

12
00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:36.740
Ibi nibyingenzi mubarwayi binubira flash cyangwa amagorofa bashobora

13
00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:41.540
bakoze amarira adasanzwe kimwe nabana batagejeje igihe cyo gusuzuma icyiciro cya retinopathie

14
00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.540
cyangwa igihe kitaragera.

15
00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:47.056
Iyindi nyungu nini ya BIO nuko yemerera kureba neza

16
00:00:47.056 --> 00:00:48.060
retina nubwo yahise

17
00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:52.460
opacite nko gukomeretsa corneal, cataracte cyangwa n'amaraso muri vitreous.

18
00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.620
Nibigenda kandi byoroshye gutwara hirya no hino.

19
00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:59.060
Irashobora rero gukoreshwa mugusuzuma abarwayi bafite umuvuduko muke nkabarwayi bari

20
00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:01.420
intebe y’ibimuga iboshye cyangwa uburiri.

21
00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:05.660
Ku barwayi badafite amakoperative nkabana bato nabana bato, mubisanzwe urashobora kubona

22
00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:10.241
igitekerezo cyiza cyinyuma yijisho niba ari cyiza cyangwa kidafite icyerekezo gito.

23
00:01:10.241 --> 00:01:10.780
Shyira i

24
00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:14.327
BIO kumutwe wawe urebe neza ko itekanye kandi ifite umutekano kuburyo ikora

25
00:01:14.327 --> 00:01:15.340
ntukimuke iyo uri

26
00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:15.760
gusuzuma.

27
00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:18.700
Urashobora kutubona duhindura hano.

28
00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:22.789
Zimya itara hanyuma urebe ko urumuri ruhujwe n'umurongo wawe wo kureba.

29
00:01:22.789 --> 00:01:23.300
Noneho rero

30
00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:26.567
gushobora kubona igikumwe cyawe wenyine muburebure bwamaboko kandi kiri hagati

31
00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:27.500
ya buri jisho

32
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.460
Bya Reba.

33
00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:31.820
Hindura urumuri rujyanye n'ikizamini

34
00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:32.805
ugiye gukora.

35
00:01:32.805 --> 00:01:35.020
Mu bana, nibyiza gutangirira hasi

36
00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:38.940
kumurika, hanyuma kwiyongera buhoro buhoro kugeza ubonye ibisobanuro bihagije

37
00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:40.700
bidateye guhungabanya umwana.

38
00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.460
Mu bantu bakuru, tangira ukoresheje uburyo

39
00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:43.511
umucyo n'ubunini.

40
00:01:43.511 --> 00:01:46.140
Ugomba gukoresha lens ya kondegene kugirango ubone

41
00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:47.452
abaterankunga hamwe na BIO.

42
00:01:47.452 --> 00:01:49.420
Hariho imbaraga zitandukanye

43
00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:54.860
hamwe nibikoreshwa cyane, abaganga 20, 28 cyangwa 30.

44
00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:58.300
Lens zitandukanye zirema imirima itandukanye yo kureba kandi bitandukanye

45
00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:02.555
impamyabumenyi yo gukuza nkuko bigaragara hano.

46
00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:06.100
Kimwe no kwisuzumisha abarwayi,

47
00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.159
menya koza intoki kandi wambaye PPE ikwiye.

48
00:02:09.159 --> 00:02:11.300
Sobanurira umurwayi ko uzaba

49
00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:15.220
gusuzuma inyuma yijisho kandi ko urumuri rwinshi rushobora kutoroha.

50
00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:16.340
Menya neza ko aribyo

51
00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:19.740
nishimiye gukomeza no gusubiza ibibazo byose bashobora kuba bafite.

52
00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.780
Vuga imboni y'ijisho b'umurwayi kugirango bashoboze

53
00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:22.928
abaterankunga buzuye.

54
00:02:22.928 --> 00:02:26.660
Anesthetic yibanze irashobora kandi gukoreshwa kugirango umurwayi amererwe neza

55
00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:27.644
mugihe c'ikizamini.

56
00:02:27.644 --> 00:02:29.940
Umurwayi agomba gusuzumwa neza abeshya

57
00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:32.020
supine cyangwa mu ntebe yicaye.

58
00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:35.140
Gusuzuma umwana birashobora kugorana kandi ugomba

59
00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:39.980
tekereza gukoresha sucrose ishaje mbere yikizamini, kuzunguruka umwana, gushiramo

60
00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:44.020
hafi ya anesthetic yaho cyangwa gukoresha speculum kugirango byorohereze isuzuma ryuzuye.

61
00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:48.820
Iyo umurwayi yagutse, icyumba kigomba gucanwa cyane kugirango habeho itandukaniro.

62
00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:51.385
Kuri iyi videwo tuzakomeza gucana.

63
00:02:51.385 --> 00:02:53.380
Ugomba gusuzuma umurwayi muri a

64
00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:55.598
ibidukikije rwose kugirango yemere ikizamini cyiza.

65
00:02:55.598 --> 00:02:57.500
Hagarara ku mutwe wa

66
00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:01.540
ihangane, hindura uburiri cyangwa intebe kugirango urebe ko wowe numurwayi uri

67
00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:01.950
byiza.

68
00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:06.460
Hindura isoko yumucyo yerekeza kumaso yumurwayi hanyuma usuzume

69
00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:07.324
umutuku.

70
00:03:07.324 --> 00:03:12.508
Noneho koresha lens ya kondegene kugirango uzane inkingi yinyuma.

71
00:03:12.508 --> 00:03:12.940
Wowe

72
00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:16.429
irashobora gufata ukuboko witonze ku gahanga k'umurwayi kugirango ituze.

73
00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:17.380
Menya neza ko

74
00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:21.028
ijisho ryumurwayi rijyanye nisoko yawe yumucyo hamwe na lensing.

75
00:03:21.028 --> 00:03:21.940
Uzagira

76
00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:24.803
kwimura lens kugirango azane abaterankunga yibanze.

77
00:03:24.803 --> 00:03:27.380
Bisaba imyitozo kugirango abaterankunga barebe

78
00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:30.295
no kworoherwa no kubona intera ikora ya lens.

79
00:03:30.295 --> 00:03:31.620
Ugomba kubimenya

80
00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:35.580
lens zitandukanye kandi abarwayi bazagira intera ikora.

81
00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:37.780
Ni ngombwa kugira

82
00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:41.885
BIO yerekana lens hamwe nubuso bwa retina kugirango bisuzumwe byose bihujwe.

83
00:03:41.885 --> 00:03:43.780
Niba ubona igicucu kuri

84
00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:48.758
mpande zuburyo bwawe, birashobora gusobanura ko kimwe muribi cyahujwe nabi.

85
00:03:48.758 --> 00:03:50.180
Kugira ngo wirinde urumuri rutifuzwa,

86
00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:55.140
urashobora kugerageza kugoreka lens kuko ibi bishobora gufasha gukuraho ibi.

87
00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.751
Zana inkingi yinyuma.

88
00:03:56.751 --> 00:03:58.900
Ugomba gusuzuma disiki ya optique na

89
00:03:58.900 --> 00:03:59.282
macular.

90
00:03:59.282 --> 00:04:03.860
Hindura umucyo ukurikije ubwiza bwo kureba no guhumuriza abarwayi.

91
00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:07.620
Kwisuzuma ryambere urumuri ruzamurika cyane kumurwayi nibi

92
00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:12.020
bizakemuka retina imaze guhumeka muri quadrants zose uko ari enye.

93
00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:16.340
Kureba retina ya peripheri, hindura uburakari ubaza umurwayi

94
00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:19.022
reba mu cyerekezo cy'akarere kigomba gusuzumwa.

95
00:04:19.022 --> 00:04:20.900
Urashobora kuzenguruka uburiri kandi

96
00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.506
kugoreka umubiri wawe kugirango urebe ikigega cya peripheri.

97
00:04:23.506 --> 00:04:25.460
Kubona urwego rwo hejuru kandi ruri hasi

98
00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:28.940
fundus, ushobora gusanga byoroshye guhagarara kuruhande rwigihe gito rwumurwayi nkuko

99
00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:29.683
vuba aha.

100
00:04:29.683 --> 00:04:31.540
Na none, ubu buhanga busaba imyitozo.

101
00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.140
Urashobora gusanga ukomeje gutakaza ibyawe

102
00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:34.477
Reba.

103
00:04:34.477 --> 00:04:38.860
Ibi birashoboka bitewe no guhuza nabi kwa lens ya BIO hamwe na

104
00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:39.912
ikigega cya peripheri.

105
00:04:39.912 --> 00:04:43.420
Niba ibi bibaye, gerageza guhindura inguni yikizamini

106
00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.320
kandi urebe ko uri kumurongo neza.

107
00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.760
Ugomba gusuzuma quadrants yose yikigega.

108
00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.800
Ugomba kumva umerewe neza kuzenguruka uburiri

109
00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:53.360
no kugoreka umubiri wawe kugirango bigufashe kubona.

110
00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:55.200
Uzakenera guhora ufunguye ijisho

111
00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:57.040
gukomeza ibitekerezo byawe n'intoki zawe.

112
00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:01.680
Niba umurwayi arwana no gukomeza icyerekezo cye cyo kureba,

113
00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.240
urashobora gukoresha intego yo gukosora

114
00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:09.750
nk'urutoki cyangwa igikumwe cy'umurwayi nkuko bigaragara hano.

115
00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:13.110
Hamwe no gutinda buhoro, BIO irashobora kwemerera amashusho

116
00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:15.310
ya peripheri ya kure ya retina.

117
00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:18.550
Ubu buhanga buzana retina y'imbere.

118
00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:20.750
Birashobora kuba byiza kureba aurisorata

119
00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.710
hanyuma urebe kuri periferique retinal patology,

120
00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.630
nk'amarira y'inyuma,

121
00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:27.790
ibyo bitabaye ibyo ntibigaragara ku kizamini gisanzwe.

122
00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:31.110
Uzakenera ibitonyanga bikwiye

123
00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:33.150
n'igikoresho cyerekana.

124
00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:36.510
Ugomba kuburira umurwayi ko ibyo bishobora kutoroha.

125
00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:38.550
Gukora skeletal indentation,

126
00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:40.190
shyira umurwayi nka mbere.

127
00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:43.510
Urashobora kwerekeza kuri sclera cyangwa hejuru yijisho.

128
00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:47.397
Saba umurwayi kureba ahandi hantu kugirango asuzumwe, emera

129
00:05:47.397 --> 00:05:48.230
indenter kuruhuka

130
00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:53.150
mu buryo bugaragara kurwanya agace kagomba gutangwa, hanyuma usabe umurwayi kureba akarere

131
00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:56.390
gusuzumwa no gushyiramo igitutu cyoroheje.

132
00:05:56.390 --> 00:06:00.510
Uru rugero rwerekana ikizamini cya retina isumba izindi zisuzumwa.

133
00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:03.550
Umurwayi asabwa kureba hasi yerekeza ibirenge byabo.

134
00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:08.110
Indenter noneho ishyirwa kumaso yo hejuru hanyuma ikazunguruka.

135
00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:11.550
Noneho umurwayi asabwa kureba hejuru.

136
00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:13.417
birakenewe igitutu cyoroheje.

137
00:06:13.417 --> 00:06:16.030
Iki ni ikizamini gikomeye kandi

138
00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:18.990
indentor izimurwa kugirango yitegereze retina.

139
00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:22.110
Ugomba gushimira umurwayi no kubaha umwanya uhagije wo gukira u

140
00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:23.977
ikizamini mbere yo kohereza.

141
00:06:23.977 --> 00:06:26.590
Andika ibyo wabonye kandi umenyeshe umurwayi

142
00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:28.954
y'umwanzuro wawe niba bikwiye.

143
00:06:28.954 --> 00:06:31.790
Ibi birangiza ikizamini cya BIO.

144
00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:35.470
Nubuhanga bugoye ariko hamwe nimyitozo uzamura imitsi

145
00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:38.270
kwibuka kugirango bigufashe gukomeza kubona neza ikigega.

146
00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:41.230
Turizera ko wasanze iyi video ifasha, urakoze cyane kubireba.
